  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "The annual income of an employee in a large company is normally distributed with a mean of $$50\\,000$ and a standard deviation of $$15\\,000.$ What is the probability that a randomly selected employee's income is more than $$46\\,700$ but less than $$56\\,150?$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places.\n\n*Hint: A table of values of $Φ(z)$ for different values of $z$ is given below, where $Φ(z)$ is the cumulative distribution function for the standard normal distribution. *\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> \n  <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.00\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.01\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.02\\,$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.2\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.4207\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.4168\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.4129\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.1\\,$</th>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.4602\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.4562\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.4522\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.0\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5000\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.4960\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.4920\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th>\n\n<th width=\"5%\"></th>\n\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> \n  <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.00\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.01\\,$</th>\n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.02\\,$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.2\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5793\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5832\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5871\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.3\\,$</th>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6179\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6217\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6255\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n  <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.4\\,$</th>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6554\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6591\\,$ </td>\n  <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6628\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>",
